      <li><a href={result}>Source-acquisition result at the reviewed revision</a> — Parts E–F contain the source interpretations and executable diagnostics; Part G records the bounded treatment and candidate ledger.</li>
      <li><a href={primaryReview}>Primary-source completion review, PR #195</a> — original-page checks, numerical recomputation, and scope.</li>
      <li><a href={closureReview}>Proposal review, PR #197</a> — treatment, independence boundary, ledger, and remaining acceptance steps.</li>
      <li><a href={`${REPO}/pull/196`}>PR #196</a> — live proposal and acceptance history.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
